## Overview
{
  "purpose": "MUST optimize prompts to ensure LLMs generate high-quality and relevant responses.",
  "application": "SHOULD be applied during the development and refinement of prompts for LLMs, especially when the output lacks clarity or relevance. NEVER assume all prompts are optimal without review.",
  "importance": "This rule matters because effective prompt optimization significantly enhances the overall performance of LLMs, leading to better user experiences and more accurate outputs."
}

## prompt_structure

{
  "description": "MUST ensure that the structure of prompts is clear and focused to maximize the LLM's understanding.",
